\" class=\\\"a-profile-avatar-wrapper\\\"><div class=\\\"a-profile-avatar\\\"><img src=\\\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif\\\" class=\\\"a-lazy-loaded\\\" data-src=\\\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><noscript><img src=\\\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png\\\"></noscript></div></div><div class=\\\"a-profile-content\\\">[RETIRE]</div></div></div><div class=\\\"_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A\\\"><i data-hook=\\\"review-star-rating\\\" class=\\\"a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5\\\"><span class=\\\"a-icon-alt\\\">5&nbsp;étoiles sur 5</span></i><span class=\\\"a-letter-space\\\"></span></div><h5 class=\\\"_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE\\\" data-hook=\\\"reviewTitle\\\" lang=\\\"it-IT\\\">Una vera sorpresa</h5><div data-hook=\\\"review-by-line\\\" class=\\\"a-row a-spacing-none\\\"><span data-hook=\\\"review-date\\\" class=\\\"a-size-base a-color-tertiary\\\">Avis laissé en Italie le 14 juin 2026</span></div><div data-hook=\\\"product-variation-attributes\\\" class=\\\"a-row a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb\\\"><div data-hook=\\\"review-badges\\\" class=\\\"_Y3Itd_review-badges_yvEgM\\\"><a class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.fr/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp\\\"><span data-hook=\\\"avp-badge\\\" class=\\\"a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold\\\">Achat vérifié</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook=\\\"reviewTextContainer\\\" class=\\\"_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM\\\"><div data-hook=\\\"reviewText\\\" class=\\\"a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P\\\" data-a-remove-top-gutter=\\\"true\\\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\\\"true\\\" name=\\\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-11\\\"><div class=\\\"a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden\\\" id=\\\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-11-teaser-describedby-collapsed\\\">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class=\\\"a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden\\\" id=\\\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-11-teaser-describedby-expanded\\\">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"customer_review_foreign-RQYXIX7FGV913_2_review_text\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"element\\\" class=\\\"a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub\\\" data-a-card-type=\\\"basic\\\" name=\\\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-11-card0\\\"><div class=\\\"a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha\\\"><div class=\\\"a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition\\\" style=\\\"height: 0px;\\\"><div><div class=\\\"a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized\\\" data-a-max-height=\\\"300\\\" style=\\\"max-height:300px\\\"><div class=\\\"_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh\\\"><div data-hook=\\\"reviewRichContentContainer\\\" lang=\\\"it-IT\\\" class=\\\"_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW\\\"><p><span>Ho acquistato questa aspirapolvere senza filo da alcune settimane e sono molto soddisfatto dell’acquisto. All’inizio ero in po’ scettico in quanto ero orientato su un marchio molto più famoso, ma ho deciso di tentate la sorte, spinto anche dalle recensioni positive.</span></p><p><span>La prima cosa che ho apprezzato è la praticità: l’assenza del cavo permette di spostarsi facilmente da una stanza all’altra senza interruzioni. È leggero, maneggevole e comoda da utilizzare anche per le pulizie quotidiane.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>La potenza di aspirazione è buona sia sui pavimenti che sui tappeti e riesce a raccogliere efficacemente polvere, briciole e peli di animali. Anche negli angoli e sotto i mobili si comporta bene grazie agli accessori inclusi.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>L’autonomia della batteria è sufficiente per pulire un appartamento di grosse dimensioni con una sola carica, un aspetto che molti utenti considerano fondamentale nelle scope elettriche senza filo.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Lo svuotamento del serbatoio è semplice e veloce, mentre la manutenzione dei filtri non richiede particolari difficoltà. Nel complesso offre un buon equilibrio tra prestazioni, praticità e comfort d’uso.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Consigliato a chi cerca un’aspirapolvere senza filo efficace per la pulizia quotidiana della casa.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"a-reactive-container-gradient\\\"></div></div></div><div data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"customer_review_foreign-RQYXIX7FGV913_2_show_more\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"element\\\" data-hook=\\\"reviewExpandButtonContainer\\\" class=\\\"a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-csa-interaction-events=\\\"click\\\"><a href=\\\"[RETIRE]\\\" class=\\\"a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button\\\" role=\\\"button\\\"><span class=\\\"a-expander-icon\\\"><i class=\\\"a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand\\\"></i></span><span class=\\\"a-see-more a-color-link\\\"><span class=\\\"a-see-more-text\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Lire la suite</span><span class=\\\"a-see-less-text\\\" style=\\\"display:none\\\">Afficher moins</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook=\\\"translationSpinner\\\" class=\\\"_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2\\\" style=\\\"display: none !important;\\\"><div class=\\\"a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ\\\"><span class=\\\"a-spinner a-spinner-medium\\\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small\\\"><div class=\\\"_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR\\\"><div data-hook=\\\"reportAbuseButton\\\" data-mix-operations=\\\"ReportAbuseOpenDialogClickHandler\\\" data-dialog-kind=\\\"modal\\\" data-asin=\\\"B0GCN57MGK\\\" data-id=\\\"RQYXIX7FGV913\\\" data-return-to=\\\"DpReview\\\" data-sign-in-url=\\\"https://www.amazon.fr/dp/B0GCN57MGK/\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"element\\\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\